      "title": "2026 Death Wish Coffee Mug",
      "handle": "2026-death-wish-coffee-mug",
      "body_html": "<h4>Mugs up to 2026. </h4>\n<p>A symbol of new beginnings fueled by coffee strong enough to wake the dead (or just the dead inside), this limited-edition, handcrafted mug boasts a never-before-seen tri-color glaze and new mug shape designed in collaboration with Deneen Pottery.</p>\n<p>The perfect addition to your growing mug collection or even the start of something new, it also comes packaged in a custom display box for the first time ever.</p>\n<p><strong>LIMITED TIME OFFER:</strong> Get 30% off a bag/box of coffee or canned lattes with your purchase of the 2026 Mug. Discount automatically applied in cart—only valid on one coffee item.</p>",
