      "id": 7469535264823,
      "title": "All-American Tank",
      "handle": "all-american-tank",
      "body_html": "<h4>Life, liberty and the pursuit of strong coffee.</h4>\n<p>Leave the days of ripping the sleeves off an old tee in the past and celebrate 250 years of American independence with a limited-edition tank as bold as the coffee that fuels you.<meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n<p>Made for those who refuse to settle for weak coffee, weak opinions or being told what they can't do, each tank features a one-of-a-kind red, white and blue tie-dye pattern and a custom Death Wish Coffee logo inspired by the iconic image of George Washington crossing the Delaware.</p>\n<p>If that doesn't scream \"'Merica,\" we're not sure what does.</p>",
